                "text": "The debt badge @RepThomasMassie gave me is a stark reminder of Washington\u2019s failures\u2014$36.2 trillion and climbing, with interest payments now exceeding Medicare and defense. \n\nEvery second, Washington burns $100,000 it doesn\u2019t have. If we don\u2019t cut spending and rebuild the economy, America will not endure.",
