                "text": "I stopped by @NovantHealth yesterday to meet with CEO Christopher Fuller and his team. \n\nWe talked about Medicare, access to rehab care, and how to make sure patients aren\u2019t unfairly denied the treatment they need. \n\nGrateful for the incredible work they do! https://t.co/p7ca5pdRTE",
