                "quoted_status_profile_username": "RapidResponse47",
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Shutdown Schumer and Senate Democrats are threatening to close the government unless they get billions for illegal immigrants, taxpayer-funded transgender surgeries, bailouts for insurance companies, and more money for NPR.\n\nThey\u2019re not fighting to protect seniors. They\u2019re not fighting to lower costs for families. They\u2019re not fighting to secure the border. They\u2019re fighting for radical pet projects that nobody outside of the far Left even wants.\n\n@HouseGOP already passed a common-sense bill to keep the government open, freeze spending for 50 days, and force debate on real appropriations.\n\nBut Schumer and the Democrats would rather shut the government down than give up a single dollar of their failed agenda. They want to gut the $50 billion rural health fund. They want to strip protections from patients and taxpayers. And they want to send your hard-earned dollars to criminals and illegal immigrants instead of to law-abiding Americans.\n\nWe\u2019re not going to cave to that. We\u2019re not going to trade away the future of this country just so the radical Left can keep their pet projects alive.\n\nThis is Schumer\u2019s shutdown, and it makes clear they care more about power than the people they swore to serve.",
