                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 83,
                "retweet_count": 59,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Democrats are dragging this country into a shutdown\u2014and for what? To give taxpayer-funded Medicare to 1.2 million illegal immigrants. It\u2019s insanity. Rewarding lawbreakers with free healthcare only fuels the border crisis, and the American people know it.\n\n@HouseGOP passed a clean bill to keep the government open. Only 7 Democrat senators are needed to stop a shutdown. Instead, Schumer and Jeffries are holding your government hostage to bankroll open borders, woke pet projects, and even bring back taxpayer funding for NPR and PBS.\n\nThe hypocrisy is staggering. Chuck Schumer once admitted you don\u2019t shut down the government over unrelated demands. Now he\u2019s doing exactly that out of political desperation.\n\nThe American people did not vote for this. They do not want to fund healthcare for illegal aliens. They do not want a trillion-dollar partisan blowout. And they are done watching their tax dollars wasted on woke nonsense while veterans, seniors, and families are put at risk.\n\nThis is betrayal. And the American people will hold Democrats accountable for it.",
