                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Day 20 of the Democrat shutdown, and it\u2019s all politics over people. \n\nRepublicans passed a clean bill to keep the government open. Democrats have blocked it 11 times while demanding $1.5 trillion in new spending, including healthcare for illegal immigrants and cuts to rural hospitals. \n\nTheir priorities are clear, and Americans are the ones paying for it.",
