                "text": "I'm proud to join nearly 50 colleagues in pressing @FHFA to reconsider its new homeowners' insurance guidance. \n\nA one-size-fits-all approach to homeowners' insurance will only make housing less affordable for American families. \n\nWe need policies that help people achieve the American Dream, not make it harder.",
