                "text": "Republicans delivered $50 billion for rural healthcare in the One Big Beautiful Bill, and North Carolina is securing up to $200 million annually from it. \n\nThat means more doctors in rural communities, accessible mental health services, and keeping small hospitals open for 3 million North Carolinians living in areas where care has been hard to reach. \n\nRural America built this country, and it's about time Washington started acting like it.",
